{"3218900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Delivered on Time", "steam_appid": 3218900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the delivery order from your car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm the drop-off location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the delivery as instructed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your car and escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if things go wrong… well, you’re on your own. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food Delivery Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being rejected by major companies despite your prestigious university degree, you’ve lost all hope and decided to become a food delivery rider. However, the delivery app you downloaded seems… glitchy. It keeps sending you to eerie locations—crumbling old neighborhoods, deserted skyscrapers, and abandoned hospitals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no worries! As a dedicated Food Delivery Hero, ghosts, hauntings, and even supernatural fights are no match for you. Your only goal is to deliver the order to the customer’s doorstep—on time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order Upgraded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The delivery mission behind each door is full of unknowns and randomness! Earn money by completing deliveries and use it to level up your rider rank. But beware—higher ranks mean more advanced (and far more dangerous) orders. Don’t forget to buy accident and life insurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compact experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a concise narrative game, with an average playtime of <strong>around 30 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h